                </div>
                <h1 class="headline">FREE-BOTS<br /><span class="slash">//</span> ONLINE.</h1>
                <p class="tagline">
                    Android &amp; Full-Stack Developer.<br />
                    <span class="muted">Automation addicted &mdash;</span> <strong>No API? No problem.</strong>
                </p>
            </div>

